@BusinessParkCompaniesManagement.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5145

### Sign in as a seeded administrator
POST {{BusinessParkCompaniesManagement.Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "<your SeedAdmin password>"
}

### List companies (replace the token first)
GET {{BusinessParkCompaniesManagement.Server_HostAddress}}/api/companies
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

###
